# Developer documentation. It lives in this repository to be read in Git or
# in an editor, and is never part of the website: nothing here may answer an
# HTTP request, on WAMP or on the server. The app itself never reads it.
#
# The Hestia deploy (.github/workflows/deploy.yml) also leaves every file in
# this folder except this one out of the upload, so a file type nginx serves
# on its own, without asking Apache, cannot slip through either.

Require all denied
